Code adapted from other projects
--------------------------------

Recorded so every licensing option stays open (SPEC OQ-3). Until a license is
chosen, no outside contributions are accepted without a sign-off.

* trammel/core/models.py — BaseModel, soft-delete managers and AppendOnlyModel
  are adapted from HomeAutoShop, homeautoshop/core/models.py
  (https://github.com/EccentricWkshp/HomeAutoShop, AGPL-3.0-or-later, same owner).
* config/settings.py — the env()/env_bool()/env_int() helpers and the DATABASE_URL
  parsing are adapted from HomeAutoShop, config/settings.py (same terms).
* Caddyfile, Dockerfile.caddy, docker/caddy-entrypoint.sh and
  config/caddy/tls-*.conf — the HTTPS proxy, its DNS-01 build and the TLS mode
  selection are adapted from HomeAutoShop's equivalents (same terms).
